 after the Sukhothai period, and it was the simple bell-shaped type of stupa introduced from Sri Lanka that eventually became the favorite model of the Thais."<br>"The ruins of Phra Phai Luang and the San Phra Sua Muang provide ample evidence that the earliest of Sukhothai\'s religious buildings were Khmer."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2037, 'temperature': 0.2})
